Description: Restore support definitions required by the ARM NEON implementation
 RNNoise 0.2 vec_neon.h references the Opus support types and macros, but the
 release archive omits the corresponding header. Provide the bounded subset
 used by that file so native arm64 builds retain NEON acceleration.
Author: USBRadioPlus contributors
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-08-30
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/os_support.h
@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+#ifndef RNNOISE_OS_SUPPORT_H
+#define RNNOISE_OS_SUPPORT_H
+
+#include <string.h>
+#include "opus_types.h"
+
+#ifndef OPUS_INLINE
+#define OPUS_INLINE inline
+#endif
+
+#define OPUS_CLEAR(dst, count) memset((dst), 0, sizeof(*(dst)) * (count))
+
+#endif
